<title>HUNGARY: RICHTER H1 '97 IAS NET PROFIT HUF 9.507BLN.</title>
<headline>RICHTER H1 '97 IAS NET PROFIT HUF 9.507BLN.</headline>
<dateline>BUDAPEST 1997-07-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six-month period ending June</p>
<p>30, 1997.</p>
<p>(Figures in millions of forints unless stated)</p>
<p>					Jan-June 1997   Jan-June 1996</p>
<p>    Operating profit		 7,754     vs    5,219</p>
<p>    Net profit before taxation   9,507     vs    6,538</p>
<p>    Net profit			 9,507     vs    6,527</p>
<p>    Sales			     24,837     vs   18,070</p>
<p>    Cost of sales		    8,862     vs    6,582</p>
<p>    Gross profit		    15,975     vs  11,488</p>
<p>    Operating expenses	     8,221     vs   6,269</p>
<p>    Royalty and similar income     417     vs     734</p>
<p>Interest income and</p>
<p>	 similar income		1,190     vs     651</p>
<p>    Interest expense		     6     vs	66</p>
<p>    Net other income		   152     vs	 0.0</p>
<p>    Exceptional income		   0.0   vs	 0.0</p>
<p>    Taxation				 0.0   vs	11.0</p>
<p>NOTE - Richter Gedeon Vegyeszeti Gyar Rt is a</p>
<p>pharmaceuticals company. The figures were calculated in</p>
<p>accordance with International Accounting Standards. The figures</p>
<p>are unaudited.</p>
